      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i just had some juice. im still kinda shaky though. i am really worried about the spike though because im usually so volatile. if i just take a tiny bit of my insulin like like 2 units, wouldn't that help keep it steady? it seems safer than just letting it go way too high after the juice hits.",
